5. The Medic: Crash Recovery
POST /v1/ingest/ftp/resume
Purpose: Resume failed jobs using the checkpoint manifests.


Backend Logic:



Verify Redis Vault credentials still exist (ext_ftp:creds:{user_id}). If missing, return 410 Gone.


Query async_ingestion_jobs to verify all provided job_ids belong to the user and are failed.


Update PostgreSQL status to pending.


Worker picks up the job, reads .manifest.json, issues FTP REST command, and resumes.


