End-to-End System Flow Summary
Connect: React sends credentials $\rightarrow$ FastAPI encrypts $\rightarrow$ Stores in Redis Vault.
Browse: React requests path $\rightarrow$ FastAPI fetches remote tree (lazy load) $\rightarrow$ Returns UI data.
Init: React queues files $\rightarrow$ FastAPI checks PostgreSQL for collisions $\rightarrow$ Writes job as pending.
Transfer: Concurrency Manager spawns worker $\rightarrow$ Worker streams 8KB chunks $\rightarrow$ Worker updates Redis cache every 1s.
Monitor: React polls batch status endpoint every 2s $\rightarrow$ FastAPI reads Redis & PostgreSQL $\rightarrow$ UI updates fluidly.
Finalize/Fail: Worker finishes (or drops) $\rightarrow$ Updates PostgreSQL state to completed or failed $\rightarrow$ React transitions UI $\rightarrow$ Manifest allows instant resume if failed.







